=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play ssh -----------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the real$
# plan/apply engine against a simulated host, hostfake's$
# recording host.System, whose commands a model of the host$
# answers. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and$
# file is the fake's, and its record is shown when play ends.$
$
# SSH Login hosts ##############################################$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Debian 13            The VM's shape$
   2) Ubuntu 26.04         ssh.socket$
   3) Alpine 3.23          No PAM, root locked$
   4) Hardened             Figma's state$
   5) Password login       cloud-init allows it$
   6) Password session     alice by password$
   7) Root's session       No SUDO_USER$
   8) hardn v0.3.2         manage.conf, listen.conf$
   9) origin/main's file   hardn.conf, passwords off$
  10) Include not first    Port 22 above it$
  11) Match block          Root, passwords from 192.0.2.0/24$
  12) AllowUsers           george alone$
  13) Proxmox VE 9         Root allowed$
  14) ufw, 22 restricted   From 192.0.2.0/24$
  15) Confirm pending      22 and 2230 held$
  16) sshd not read        Before the first connection$
  17) Alpine, admin locked george "!", no PAM$
  18) RSA key too short    1024 bits, 2048 asked$
  19) Admin without sudo   sudo asks a password$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-19 or q]: 4$
$
# Info: ssh/hardened$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13 (OpenSSH 10.0p2).$
# 00-hardn.conf sets Port 2230, PermitRootLogin no and$
# PasswordAuthentication no; ufw allows 2230. george's session$
# is on 2230.$
$
# SSH Login ####################################################$
$
  [+] SSH Login            Configured root disallowed$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured key-only auth$
  [+] SSH Port             Configured non-default (2230)$
$
  SSH Configuration --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Root SSH Login       Disallowed$
   -  Password Login       Off$
   -  SSH Port             2230$
   -  Allowed Users        Anyone$
   -  Logged in as         george, by key$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Allow root key-only  Root logs in by key alone$
   2) Password login on    Let passwords log in again$
   3) Change SSH port      Now 2230$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-3 or q]: 0$
$
# SSH Login hosts ##############################################$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Debian 13            The VM's shape$
   2) Ubuntu 26.04         ssh.socket$
   3) Alpine 3.23          No PAM, root locked$
   4) Hardened             Figma's state$
   5) Password login       cloud-init allows it$
   6) Password session     alice by password$
   7) Root's session       No SUDO_USER$
   8) hardn v0.3.2         manage.conf, listen.conf$
   9) origin/main's file   hardn.conf, passwords off$
  10) Include not first    Port 22 above it$
  11) Match block          Root, passwords from 192.0.2.0/24$
  12) AllowUsers           george alone$
  13) Proxmox VE 9         Root allowed$
  14) ufw, 22 restricted   From 192.0.2.0/24$
  15) Confirm pending      22 and 2230 held$
  16) sshd not read        Before the first connection$
  17) Alpine, admin locked george "!", no PAM$
  18) RSA key too short    1024 bits, 2048 asked$
  19) Admin without sudo   sudo asks a password$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-19 or q]: 0$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
